{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fecd5df86ada6bc3a06f1efc287d76165c3767ab7a68f8375512b8243ab44984", "ja": "（ゲーム型バラエティ番組に敵役で百合子とロコが\n参加した。結果はなんであれ、撮影が無事終わった！）", "zh": "（百合子和ROCO参加了游戏综艺节目的反派角色。结果如何暂且不论，拍摄总算顺利结束了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "3a13114c5adb54a16aa5fbea0118dbc0e4d945ed329d9f70c7ab3c261b79ec26", "ja": "{$P$}、ヘルプです～！\nもう撮影は終わったのに、ユリコが～！", "zh": "{$P$}，救命啊～！\n明明拍摄已经结束了，可百合子她～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "f40f79c19a23302b1c9ec64d6921aab4c630abe8d7c44bfde8a9f17bf753e970", "ja": "ククク……。案ずることはない、我が同胞よ。\n使命を終えたとて、魂が朽ちることはないのだから！", "zh": "呵呵呵……不必担心，我的同胞。\n即使使命已经完成，灵魂也不会腐朽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e89c13b45fd8df4bb3de4709ed64ffaefe991d94b0c3200df36b3fff5534fefb", "ja": "百合子……。すごく気に入ってるみたいだな。\nでも撮影は終わったし……よし！", "zh": "百合子……看来你真的很喜欢啊。不过拍摄已经结束了……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1004_p", "source_sha256": "370d29eee5e94e2f66133bf3669b6cd81a4d5cf94d69bada4ac17937125e3c98", "ja": "なあ、百合子……いや、ユリコ・メイキー。\n来訪者は立ち去った。鬼の役目はもう終わりだ！", "zh": "喂，百合子……不，尤莉可·梅基。  \n来访者已经离去。鬼的使命已经结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "f5fca4764c5380d62353566b5c19bb6ecc4d2cd5814f6033fd22cca00efd1c51", "ja": "この愉悦を自ら手放せと？　であれば、否だ。\nこの漆黒き風の力を、世界に知らしめなければ……！", "zh": "要我亲手放弃这份愉悦？那可不行。必须让全世界知晓这漆黑之风的力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fe94a24b030c43e33b0979b02553da337995200eb78485a78f25a20f1df35c75", "ja": "くっ……なんという精神力だ！", "zh": "可恶……这是何等强大的精神力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "c459c2e369bb925fd2cb2f68c6408bd21f623bb24fbbf9e09bb109b3ad828201", "ja": "{$P$}でもインポッシブルだなんて。\nどこかにユリコをデフォルトにする方法が……。", "zh": "连{$P$}都不可能办到吗。\n到底哪里才有让百合子恢复初始状态的方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "628f4cfd1f93e85c411933af24c059cdb5a935971fc68dd184906c2768fbf916", "ja": "ハッ！　ユリコがいつもメモしていたノートに、\n何かヒントがあるかもしれません！", "zh": "哈！百合子平时总在记笔记的本子里，说不定就有些什么线索！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9e8a42c3806c9d98bbb3032b192a7e17bc225d3815afc4a70c54d21c467b958", "ja": "わーっ！？　ダメ、それだけはダメだよロコちゃん！\nあれは……そう！　禁じられた書物のようなものでっ！", "zh": "哇——！？不行，只有那个绝对不行啊，ROCO！\n那个是……对！可以说是禁忌之书一般的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1010_p", "source_sha256": "455a448f2b7a6f5e1004ff37fcd663f02bc3e22afb420e825c6934463918595a", "ja": "（ロコのファインプレー？により、\nようやく百合子は現実を受け入れたようだ……）", "zh": "（多亏了ROCO的精彩表现？\n百合子终于像是接受了现实……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "b2f02635169981cbc4d32d3ebd70a7c99288b45115ce25a9adc4a7f02756ba53", "ja": "はぁ……。とうとう終わっちゃったんですね。\n楽しかったなぁ、悪役になりきるの。", "zh": "哈啊……终于结束了呢。\n扮演反派真开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "4f6aab379df7efc336a2d7401bc516d8851f304cf7b8a0786932e07b9ffa0a08", "ja": "はい……。ユリコがクリエイトしたヴィランズは、\nどれもパーフェクトでしたからね！", "zh": "是的……百合子创作的反派们，每一个都完美无缺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "152b79be407f786e7c1fbf9980c23700ede226df65bebae095233f4bdb72b560", "ja": "ううん。私は、ただ設定とかを提案しただけで……。\n最終的に形にしてくれたのは、スタッフさんだよ。", "zh": "不是啦。我只是提议了一些设定之类的……最终把它们具体呈现出来的是工作人员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e1d1f75c5673fbcee2608fc09d9ed29852be1b5d40b68bd59a1b011df9c6245d", "ja": "でも、百合子の熱意がなかったら、こんなに魅力的な\n悪役にはならなかったよ。よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "不过，要是没有百合子的热情，也不会塑造出这么有魅力的反派。你做得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "dd0553cc4b01fee876419b23667992c57ec8615c6e663f28fdf89f2f28b048f1", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　えへへ……。\nこんな形で、番組のお手伝いができて嬉しいです！", "zh": "真、真的吗？　嘿嘿……\n能以这样的方式为节目出一份力，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "dd33182ae84d9fabfb57ac7cdca2865add8efceb7c9958bd9b75ff636ad16ff9", "ja": "はい！　本番はソーリーでしたけど……。でもロコは\nエキサイトできたので、ノープロブレムです♪", "zh": "是的！虽然正式演出时表现得不太好……不过ROCO能兴奋起来，所以没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1017_p", "source_sha256": "886e9ce3108eef19d2b9d37e14e52474ee9776e1727640b87e4cc93a52e059dc", "ja": "二人が楽しめたならよかった。上手くいったように\nみえても、気持ちが不完全燃焼なら意味が無いからな。", "zh": "只要你们两个人都享受其中，那就好。就算看起来进行得很顺利，如果心里没有尽兴，也就没有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6815f5230fb0ea915d6f01df90dbe8a047419dc88f8156e7b00a825e98ec39a", "ja": "そういうことなら大丈夫ですよ。私達、全力を\n出し切りましたから！　精神的にも体力的にも……。", "zh": "既然如此，就没问题了。我们已经拼尽全力了！无论是精神上还是体力上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f03a05ee7f5b80d5885fb296fd2066bc84b74c37b901b1faabdfa4952a37f55", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}！　ロコはまた、\nユリコとクリエイティブなことがしたいです！", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}！ROCO还想再和百合子一起做有创意的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "dce35b28513acdeeb0db99d9fa4f675676bc50122e40ae69d9fc7310e1db6c24", "ja": "次はユリコのユニークなセンスを、もっともっと\nエクスプロージョンさせたいって思ってます。", "zh": "下次我想让百合子的独特品味绽放得更加更加绚丽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "28cb51a52ce75d66124d11188fd729313aa45df0ca93fc6eb04247417533d8b9", "ja": "ロコちゃん……！　それなら私は、ロコアートを\n活かしたカッコいい設定を考えちゃおうかな、ふふっ♪", "zh": "ROCO……！那样的话，我要不要来想个能发挥ROCO艺术的帅气设定呢，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0474_1022_p", "source_sha256": "030a2e69da9b5c5d2c7f3410a69d9da13e7023a85ba2b06cccf1a5c220665b1d", "ja": "（百合子とロコの熱意で、たくさんの妄想が形になる\nだろう。どんな夢を見せてくれるのか、楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（在百合子和ROCO的热情下，许多妄想都会化为现实吧。真期待她们会展现出怎样的梦想啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
